pkg:Evidence_v1_24_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.24.0 (STORY-11 closed -- Conformance regression fixed)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: user uploaded a real session log recording an actual pipeline run's Conformance failure, quoted precisely. Traced to its exact cause by reading the code: LINEAGE_TTL, one of 5 graphs the real SHACL worker merges, had been emptied during this session's own earlier cleanup without a minimal valid replacement for this subject -- a real regression this session introduced, not a pre-existing defect. Reproduced the exact failure with real pyshacl outside the browser, matching the SHACL worker's own merge logic exactly, confirmed byte-for-byte before touching anything. Fixed with a minimal, real declaration; re-ran the identical reproduction against the live patched file and confirmed the violation is gone. Separately confirmed and fixed: a redundant 'All Sections' jump-tree inside the Explorer sidebar duplicated the always-visible top nav bar with no added value -- removed, click-handler confirmed already null-guarded. Re-verified via real Playwright: 0 console/page errors. Re-verified: pipeline order (40 subjects, reproduces), full SHACL 0 violations."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "55b1f03bf97a66a096edb764f0037784a8221ccb6e70cf695cc2d9e8846536ea"^^xsd:string .
